{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4029768","formula":"C₉H₁₂FN","hill":"C9H12FN","elements":["H","C","N","F"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"F":1.0,"H":12.0,"N":1.0},"names":{"en":"2-fluoroamphetamine","ru":"2-Фторамфетамин"},"descriptions":{"en":"2-Fluoroamphetamine (2-FA) is a stimulant drug from the amphetamine family which has been sold as a designer drug. 2-Fluoroamphetamine differs from 3-fluoroamphetamine and 4-fluoroamphetamine in the position of the fluorine atom on the aromatic ring, making them positional isomers of one another. The replacement of a hydrogen atom with a fluorine atom in certain compounds to facilitate passage through the blood–brain barrier, as is desirable in central nervous system pharmaceutical agents, is a common practice due to the corresponding increase in lipophilicity granted by this substitution.","ru":"2-Фторамфетамин (2-FA, 2-фтораминопропан) — психоактивное вещество, стимулятор ЦНС. По своим фармакологическим свойствам практически идентичен амфетамину. Является агонистом и дофаминовых, и серотониновых рецепторов. При пероральном употреблении эффект наступает через 30-50 минут и продолжается от 3 до 10 часов, в зависимости от дозировки."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":121531,"mass":153.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(CC1=CC=CC=C1F)N","inchikey":"GDSXNLDTQFFIEU-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1-(2-fluorophenyl)propan-2-amine","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"121531","atoms":23,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.536,"y":-2.266,"z":-0.154,"el":"F"},{"x":-3.645,"y":0.206,"z":-0.403,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.295,"y":0.476,"z":0.099,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.258,"y":-0.19,"z":-0.826,"el":"C"},{"x":0.166,"y":0.064,"z":-0.418,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.209,"y":-0.027,"z":1.54,"el":"C"},{"x":0.993,"y":-1.007,"z":-0.102,"el":"C"},{"x":0.639,"y":1.369,"z":-0.363,"el":"C"},{"x":2.314,"y":